  "description": "Clean Architecture Solution Template for .NET 9 with essential features ready to use out of the box.\n      \n      ✅ Layered architecture following Clean Architecture principles\n      ✅ CQRS with MediatR implementation\n      ✅ Entity Framework Core with SQL Server support\n      ✅ API with OpenAPI/Swagger documentation\n      ✅ Built-in validation using FluentValidation\n      ✅ Docker and Docker Compose support\n      ✅ Automated testing with xUnit\n      ✅ Logging and exception handling infrastructure",
